<title>UK: KEPIT shares suspended.</title>
<headline>KEPIT shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kleinwort European Privatisation Investment Trust Plc (KEPIT) said its shares were temporarily suspended on the London Stock Exchange at its own request from 0730 GMT Monday, &quot;pending completion of liquidation proposals.&quot;</p>
</text>
